{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124194","id":4749344941,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGxVArQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124194","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124194.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124194.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124194","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124194/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124194/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124194/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/22eb67f90e290dee40c8759d447b14c528be2ab3","number":124194,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix skin stride for vertices with 8 bone indices","user":{"login":"partybusiness","id":22421352,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDIxMzUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22421352?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/partybusiness","html_url":"https://github.com/partybusiness","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/partybusiness/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/partybusiness/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/partybusiness/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/partybusiness/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/partybusiness/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/partybusiness/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/partybusiness/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/partybusiness/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/partybusiness/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #117680\r\n\r\nThe bug I saw in that issue was that when a mesh had the ARRAY_FLAG_USE_8_BONE_WEIGHTS flag set, then the values in BONE_INDICES and BONE_WEIGHTS were incorrect. It seemed like it received a list containing groups of 8 values but was still treating it like groups of 4. So the value of BONE_INDICES for vertex 1 is correct, but the value of BONE_INDICES for vertex 2 is just the next four values for vertex 1, and so on.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI found two locations where a skin_stride variable was incremented by `4 * sizeof(int16_t)` without checking for the value of the flag. Changing those to use 8 instead of 4 in the case that ARRAY_FLAG_USE_8_BONE_WEIGHTS was set, seems to let the shader render correctly.\r\n\r\nIn one of those locations, there's a `attribs[i].size = 4;` and I tried also setting that to 8 when the flag is set, but it would cause crashes, and from testing it doesn't appear necessary to fix this issue.\r\n\r\nI've created a minimal test project that shows the issue this is trying to solve:\r\n\r\n[bone_indices_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33071010/bone_indices_test.zip)\r\n\r\nI've also tried out some other skinned meshes and haven't encountered bugs introduced by this.\r\n\r\nAfter this fix, BONE_INDICES and BONE_WEIGHTS in the shader contain the first four values rather than all eight, but getting the correct four values, I think is more important than getting all eight. I was using a shader to visually highlight a targeted bone, and the values are ordered from highest weight to lowest weight, so getting the first four would have been fine for my use.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/